  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>. If the sum of the roots is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>, where G.C.D <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;then the value of&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> ….(i)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math> or a multiple of <math><mi>π</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> (feasible region)&nbsp;</p><p>Hence, from (i), we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <math><mo>…</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p>"
  }
